 "notes": "Water Wonderland (2024) and the three legacy plates are optional standard-issue designs, not charity plates; the Semiquincentennial plate is sold only during 2026. SOS's 2025 list also shows Boy Scouts of America and Be the Match special-organization plates not in the game (start dates unconfirmed), and an animal-welfare plate (Michigan Pet Alliance) was signed into law but had no confirmed launch date; Spectacular Peninsulas is discontinued but still on roads."
